  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Now go and continue your pilgrim\u2019s journey! May your trip take place
      under the best conditions!"
  - speaker: 1
    text: If you ever meet our God upstairs, I would like you to ask him for me why
      he lets so many atrocities happen in front of his eyes without taking action.
  - speaker: 0
    text: I promise to ask him if I can, goodbye.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Farewell my friend, good climb.
